 derived from Australian cows that are grass-fed and graze year-round on beautiful pastures."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No worries of contaminants or unnatural compounds. \r\nOur whey contains no genetically engineered materials. Its hormone-free, chemical-free, and pesticide-free."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Optimal Protein Supplementation\r\nAssists with weight management\r\nImproves muscle strength\r\nHelps with overall health & well-being"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Full range and highest levels of natural occurring Glutathione precursors\r\nCovalent bonded cysteine, lactoferrin & Immunoglobulins"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: Mix 1 scoop into 4 to 8 oz. of water, milk, or dairy substitute. For best results, mix in a blender or shaker."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Caution: Consult your healthcare practitioner before using this product if you are pregnant, nursing or under medical supervision."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Vital Sports Series"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Exercise performance & results optimizer"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Allergen statement: Contains milk"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No wheat, gluten or preservatives"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Shake jar before opening to ensure proper serving size."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"This is a natural product and may exhibit density, color and taste variations.\r\nProduced in the USA at a GMP facility.